---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import ToolsExplorer from '../../../components/tools/ToolsExplorer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ceph 与 Kubernetes 计算器及换算工具 | InfraOpsX"
  description="面向 Ceph、Kubernetes 和基础设施容量规划的实用浏览器工具。"
  lang="zh-CN"
  canonicalPath="/zh/tools/"
  enPath="/tools/"
  zhPath="/zh/tools/"
>
  <Header locale="zh" switchHref="/tools/" />

  <main>
    <section class="tools-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="tools-breadcrumb">
          <a href="/zh/">首页</a>
          <span>/</span>
          <span>工具</span>
        </div>

        <span class="section-label">INFRAOPSX 工具</span>
        <h1>面向真实基础设施的实用工具。</h1>
        <p>面向 Kubernetes、存储和日常运维场景的浏览器工具。</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" data-seo-entry-links aria-labelledby="tool-pick-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="section-label">按任务选工具</span>
          <h2 id="tool-pick-heading">遇到什么规划或单位换算问题？</h2>
          <p>已上线的三个工具都在浏览器本地运行。计算结果用于辅助规划，生产决策仍需结合真实集群状态核实。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <h3><a href="/zh/tools/ceph-capacity-calculator/">Ceph 存储容量计算器 →</a></h3>
            <p>估算等容量 OSD 的副本或 EC 方案，区分原始容量、理论可用容量及考虑预留比例后的规划容量。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3><a href="/zh/tools/kubernetes-resource-calculator/">Kubernetes 资源计算器 →</a></h3>
            <p>规划 CPU、内存 Requests/Limits、节点池承载能力与需要预留的资源余量。</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3><a href="/zh/tools/kubernetes-quantity-converter/">Kubernetes Quantity 换算器 →</a></h3>
            <p>解析 YAML 中 CPU 毫核与内存 SI/二进制单位，并识别容易写错的数量格式。</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ToolsExplorer locale="zh" />
  </main>

  <Footer locale="zh" />
</BaseLayout>
